---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ABOH LEGAL"
  description="How ABOH LEGAL collects, uses, shares, and protects personal information under Alberta's Personal Information Protection Act."
>
  <Hero label="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />

  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">ABOH LEGAL ("we", "us", "our") is the operating name of Prince Aboh Professional Corporation, a law firm at 4937 48 Avenue, St. Paul, Alberta T0A 3A4. This policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect personal information on this website (www.abohlegal.ca), on our booking page, and when you contact us. We follow Alberta's <em>Personal Information Protection Act</em> (PIPA) and our duty of confidentiality as lawyers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">2. Our Privacy Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">Prince Aboh, Barrister and Solicitor, is responsible for our privacy practices. He can answer questions about how we collect, use, share, or store personal information, including through service providers outside Canada. Email <a href="mailto:info@abohlegal.ca" class="text-gold underline hover:no-underline">info@abohlegal.ca</a>, call <a href="tel:+18254610107" class="text-gold underline hover:no-underline">(825) 461-0107</a>, or write to the address above.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">3. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-body-text leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, location, the other party's name, the type of legal problem, and your message.</li>
          <li><strong>Online booking:</strong> your name, email address, the other party's name, the type of legal problem, your phone number if you choose a phone call, any note about a safe way to reach you, and the time you book.</li>
          <li><strong>Email, phone, and text messages:</strong> what you send or tell us. Calls and texts to our office line may be recorded or transcribed.</li>
          <li><strong>Website visits:</strong> our website host receives technical details such as your IP address, browser type, and the pages you visit. We also count visits with a tool that does not use cookies.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed mt-4">Until we confirm that we can act for you, please give us only what we need to check for conflicts of interest: your name, the other party's name, and the type of legal problem.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We use your information to reply to you, check for conflicts of interest, decide whether we can help, schedule appointments, and communicate with you about your case. We do not sell personal information. We do not use it for marketing without your consent.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">5. Service Providers, Including Outside Canada</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We use service providers to host this website, receive form messages, run our booking page, count website visits, and run our email, phone, text, and video meeting systems. Some of them are outside Canada, mainly in the United States, so your information may be collected, used, or stored there.</p>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed mt-4">These providers may use your information only to provide their services to us. Information stored outside Canada is subject to the laws of that country, and its authorities may be able to access it. For written information about our policies on service providers outside Canada, or with any questions, contact our privacy contact in section 2.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">6. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">This website does not use cookies for tracking or analytics. Services you reach through links on this website, such as our booking page, may set their own cookies under their own policies.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">7. How Long We Keep It</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We keep inquiry information as long as we need it to reply, to check for conflicts of interest, and to meet our legal and professional duties. If we do not act for you, we keep only what we need for those purposes, and we protect it as confidential.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">8. Security</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We use reasonable security measures to protect personal information from unauthorized access, collection, use, disclosure, copying, change, or destruction.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">9. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-4">Under PIPA, you may:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-body-text leading-relaxed">
          <li>ask to see the personal information we hold about you, and how we have used or shared it;</li>
          <li>ask us to correct an error or omission in it; and</li>
          <li>withdraw or change your consent, with reasonable notice, subject to our legal and professional duties.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed mt-4">To make a request, contact our privacy contact in section 2. If you are not satisfied with our answer, you can contact the Office of the Information and Privacy Commissioner of Alberta.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">10. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">This website is not aimed at children under 18. We do not knowingly collect their personal information through it.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-navy text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-3">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-body-text leading-relaxed">We may update this policy. We will post any change on this page with a new date.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">Last updated: October 1, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
